---
layout: layouts/base.njk
seoTitle: "Snider Consulting Group | Student-run consulting at the University of Maryland"
description: "UMD's student-run consulting group, solving real problems for campus organizations and nonprofits since 2020, in partnership with EY."
bodyClass: has-hero page-home
hideBanner: true
---
{#- Home page: six blocks only, per docs/HOME-LAYOUT.md (supersedes SPEC 5.1).
    Find your seat, How a project works, past clients, press and the CTA band
    live on /join/, /about/ and /partners/. -#}
{%- from "components/ui.njk" import tbdText, tbdBlock, media with context -%}
{%- from "components/work-card.njk" import workCard with context -%}
{%- from "components/project-dialog.njk" import projectDialog with context -%}
{%- set hero = generatedImages.hero -%}
{%- set community = generatedImages.community -%}
{%- set featured = featuredProjects.slice(0, 3) -%}
{%- set verifiedStats = [] -%}
{%- for s in site.stats -%}{%- if s.verified and verifiedStats.length < 4 %}{% set verifiedStats = (verifiedStats.push(s), verifiedStats) %}{% endif -%}{%- endfor -%}

<div class="hero-wrap">
  {%- if hero %}
  <picture class="hero-wrap__bg">
    <source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ hero.webpSrcset }}" sizes="100vw">
    <img src="{{ hero.src }}" srcset="{{ hero.jpgSrcset }}" sizes="100vw" width="{{ hero.width }}" height="{{ hero.height }}" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
  </picture>
  {%- endif %}

  {# 1. Hero -------------------------------------------------------------- #}
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="container hero__inner">
      <h1 class="hero__title" id="hero-title">Welcome to the <span class="hero__name">Snider Consulting Group</span></h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">UMD's student-run consulting group, solving real problems for campus organizations and nonprofits since {{ site.established }}.</p>
      <p class="hero__partner">In partnership with Ernst &amp; Young</p>
    </div>
    {%- if site.images.hero_is_standin and not env.production and not env.hidePlaceholders %}
    <span class="standin-tag standin-tag--hero" data-placeholder="true" data-todo="[TBD: hero background photo; the McKeldin Mall aerial is a stand-in (site.json → images.hero)]">Stand-in photo</span>
    {%- endif %}
  </section>

  {# 2. Stat strip: verified stats only ------------------------------------ #}
  {%- if verifiedStats.length %}
  <section class="stat-strip" aria-label="SCG at a glance">
    <div class="container">
      <dl class="stat-strip__list">
        {%- for s in verifiedStats %}
        <div class="stat-strip__item"><dt>{{ s.label }}</dt><dd>{{ s.value }}</dd></div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}
</div>

{# 3. Community ------------------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="home-block community" aria-labelledby="community-title">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split__text">
      <h2 class="home-title" id="community-title">Our <span class="accent-red">Community</span></h2>
      <p>SCG is built around a simple commitment: a collaborative environment where members share what they know and look out for one another. It is one of SCG's three pillars.</p>
      <p>Each week, members come together for a general body meeting or workshop and meet with their project teams, plus occasional social outings. {{ tbdText("[TBD: one sentence on a signature tradition or retreat]") }}</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/team/">Meet the Team</a>
    </div>
    <figure class="split__media photo-frame">
      {%- if community %}
      <picture>
        <source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ community.webpSrcset }}" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 540px, 92vw">
        <img src="{{ community.src }}" srcset="{{ community.jpgSrcset }}" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 540px, 92vw"
             width="{{ community.width }}" height="{{ community.height }}" alt="{{ site.images.community_alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </picture>
      {%- if site.images.community_is_standin and not env.production and not env.hidePlaceholders %}
      <figcaption class="standin-tag" data-placeholder="true" data-todo="[TBD: candid collage of member photos for Our Community (site.json → images.community)]">Stand-in photo</figcaption>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- else %}
      {{ media(site.images.community, site.images.community_alt, "PHOTO: Collage of candid member photos (4:3)", "4 / 3") }}
      {%- endif %}
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

{# 4. Our Work (dark) ----------------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="home-block home-block--ink work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="work__head">
      <h2 class="home-title" id="work-title">Our <span class="accent-gold">Work</span></h2>
      <p class="work__intro">We work alongside our clients to create personalized, long-lasting solutions that serve and elevate UMD's community. Each engagement is led by a student team and guided by consultants and partners from EY.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="work__grid">
      {%- for p in featured %}
      {{ workCard(p, loop.index, 3) }}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="btn-row btn-row--center work__more">
      <a class="btn btn--gold" href="/projects/">View all projects</a>
    </p>

    {%- if testimonials.length %}
    {% include "partials/testimonials.njk" %}
    {%- elif not env.production and not env.hidePlaceholders %}
    <div class="work__testimonial-ph">
      {{ tbdBlock("Client testimonials appear here", "[TBD: client quotes with written permission (data/testimonials.json, consent_to_publish: true)]") }}
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{# 5. Where SCG takes you ---------------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="home-block places" aria-labelledby="places-title">
  <div class="container split split--reverse">
    <div class="split__text">
      <h2 class="home-title" id="places-title">Where SCG <span class="accent-red">Takes You</span></h2>
      <p>Members build their skills through an intensive 10-week professional development program, originally designed by SCG members and alumni at Bain and Capital One. Along the way they connect with alumni at EY, Deloitte, Capital One, Bain and other firms through site visits, workshops, mentorship and social events.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/alumni/">Explore Alumni</a>
    </div>
    <div class="split__media">
      <div class="employer-card">
        <h3 class="employer-card__title">Our members work at…</h3>
        <ul class="employer-card__grid">
          {%- for name in site.member_employers.names %}
          <li>{{ name }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        {#- No stat row here: the home stat strip already shows these figures. -#}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{ projectDialog(featured) }}
